Per-signal availability summary

Usage: vendo measurement signals list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json  Output raw JSON
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo measurement signals list
  $ vendo measurement signals list --json
